<table role="presentation" width="100%">
  <tr>
    <td class="content">
      <h2>Service Disconnection Notice</h2>
      <p>Hello,</p>
      <p>
        We are writing to inform you that <strong><%= companyName %></strong> has closed
        their account on our platform, effective <strong><%= effectiveDate %></strong>.
      </p>
    </td>
  </tr>

  <tr>
    <td class="content" style="padding-top: 0;">
      <div class="detail-card">
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">What This Means For You</h3>
        <ul style="line-height: 1.8;">
          <li>Your vendor account has been <strong>disconnected</strong> from <%= companyName %></li>
          <li>Any pending payouts will be processed according to the existing schedule</li>
          <li>You will no longer receive new service requests from this client</li>
          <li>Your account on our platform remains active for other clients</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </td>
  </tr>

  <tr>
    <td class="content">
      <p>
        If you have questions about pending payouts or this disconnection, please contact
        our support team.
      </p>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
